# AAI-540 Group 1 Final Project — push only notebooks/ and the processed
# data folder. Everything else (sources, doc generators, deliverables,
# archive, environment) stays local.

# --- Environment & OS noise ---
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.DS_Store

# --- Data policy ---
# Raw extracts (~881 MB) are re-downloadable from the public S3 bucket
